Write & Improve Corpus 2024 -- text not included

The Write & Improve Corpus 2024 (Cambridge University Press & Assessment; Diane Nicholls,
Andrew Caines, Paula Buttery) is distributed under its own licence agreement and may not
be redistributed. This folder therefore contains only the essay IDs of the splits used
in the paper:

  train_resplit_ids.json      400 essays (finetuning set)
  dev_resplit_1000_ids.json  1000 essays (evaluation set)

Each entry is {"id": <MultiGEC-2025 essay_id>, "multigec_split": "train" | "dev"}, in
split order.

To use these splits:

  1. Obtain the MultiGEC-2025 dataset (https://lt3.ugent.be/resources/multigec-dataset)
     and the Write & Improve 2024 subset, agreeing to their licence terms.
  2. From the repository root, run

       python data_prep/rebuild_writeandimprove2024.py \
           --multigec-dir /path/to/multigec-2025/english/writeandimprove2024

     which writes train_resplit.json and dev_resplit_1000.json into this folder,
     byte-identical to the files used in the paper.

Do not commit the rebuilt files; .gitignore excludes them.
